  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      216.11,
      401.87,
      283.81
    ],
    "text": "6.(1) It shall be lawful for the Corporation, from time totime, at any General Meeting of the members and by amajority of not less than two-thirds of the members persent tomake rules, not inconsistent with the provisions of this Actor any other written law, on all or any of the followingmatters:\u2014",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Bold",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      289.31,
      401.86,
      310.93
    ],
    "text": "(a)the Classification of members, and the admission,expulsion, removal or withdrawal of members;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      316.43,
      401.86,
      349.45
    ],
    "text": "(b)the election of office bearers, the resignation fromvacation of or removal from office of office bearersand their powers, conduct and duties;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      354.95,
      401.86,
      376.57
    ],
    "text": "(c)the election of the members of the Committees ofthe Management and its powers, conduct and duties;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      382.07,
      401.87,
      438.13
    ],
    "text": "(d)the procedure to be observed at and the summoningand holding of meetings of the Committee ofManagement or sub Committee and of the time,placse, notices, and agenda of such meetings, thequorum thereof and the conduct of business thereof;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      178.29,
      443.63,
      401.85,
      476.77
    ],
    "text": "(e)the powers conduct, duties and functions of thevarious officers, agents and servants of theCorporation;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      179.85,
      482.27,
      401.83,
      503.89
    ],
    "text": "(f)the administrations and management of the propertyof the Corporation; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      177.57,
      509.39,
      401.87,
      531.01
    ],
    "text": "(g)the management of the affairs of the Corporation,and the accomplishment of its objects.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times-Italic",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      536.61,
      401.86,
      569.53
    ],
    "text": "(2) Any rule made by the Corporation may be amended,altered, added to or rescinded at a like meeting and in likemanner as a rule made under subsection (1),",
